@startuml topologia-pruebas-aws-notenant-horizontal
title Topología de Pruebas LinkGuard — AWS (sin tenants, admin-only)

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #34495E
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 120
skinparam noteFontSize 9
scale max 1100x850

' ============================================================
' ADMIN (único operador)
' ============================================================

rectangle "admin (operador global) — ADMIN_TOKEN único" as admin_tenant #FFF9C4

' ============================================================
' ORCHESTRATOR (AWS) — nodo único
' ============================================================

node "Orchestrator + HUB\n34.193.139.170 (AWS us-east-1)\nOrch :8000 XML-RPC | Hub :9000 wg-HUB :51820\nstate.json · secrets · jwt_secret" as Orch #E3F2FD

' ============================================================
' CLOUD PEERS (EC2) — fila horizontal (admin = amarillo)
' ============================================================

together {
    node "EC2 Ubuntu\n54.210.49.136\nwg0: .2\npeer-100-31-255-119" as PeerUbuntu #FFF9C4
    node "EC2 Amazon Linux\n3.228.113.66\nwg0: .3\npeer-34-207-174-76" as PeerAmazon #FFF9C4
    node "EC2 AlmaLinux\n98.87.229.24\nwg0: .4\npeer-184-72-71-143" as PeerAlma #FFF9C4
}

' ============================================================
' TERMINAL PEERS — fila horizontal
' ============================================================

together {
    node "Jump Host\n100.115.215.49\nroot / password" as Jump #FFE0B2
    node "VM40 Alpine\n172.20.0.40\nwg0: .5\npeer-172-20-0-40 (openrc)" as PeerVM40 #FFF9C4
    node "RPi5 RPi OS\n172.20.0.7\nwg0: .6\npeer-172-20-0-7 (systemd)" as PeerRPi5 #FFF9C4
}

' ============================================================
' QEMU TESTBED — fila horizontal
' ============================================================

together {
    node "orq Alpine\n192.168.100.10\npeer01 wg0: .7 (openrc)" as QEMUorq #FFF9C4
    node "pa Alpine\n192.168.100.20\npeer02 wg0: .8 (openrc)" as QEMUpa #FFF9C4
    node "pb Alpine\n192.168.100.30\npeer03 wg0: .9 (openrc)" as QEMUpb #FFF9C4
}

' ============================================================
' WIREGUARD OVERLAY
' ============================================================

rectangle "WireGuard Overlay 10.20.30.0/24 | Hub .1 | 8 peers .2-.9 (sin distinción lógica)" as wg_overlay #BBDEFB

' ============================================================
' RELACIONES — Cadena vertical entre filas (control plane)
' ============================================================

admin_tenant -down-> Orch : ADMIN_TOKEN (sin USER_ID)

Orch -down-> PeerUbuntu : register / heartbeat (XML-RPC)
PeerUbuntu -[hidden]right-> PeerAmazon
PeerAmazon -[hidden]right-> PeerAlma

PeerAlma -[hidden]down-> Jump
Jump -[hidden]right-> PeerVM40
PeerVM40 -[hidden]right-> PeerRPi5

PeerRPi5 -[hidden]down-> QEMUorq
QEMUorq -[hidden]right-> QEMUpa
QEMUpa -[hidden]right-> QEMUpb

QEMUpb -[hidden]down-> wg_overlay

' ============================================================
' RELACIONES — Data Plane (representativa por grupo, -up-> hacia Orch)
' ============================================================

PeerUbuntu -up-> Orch : wg-HUB (EC2)
PeerVM40 -up-> Orch : wg-HUB NAT (terminal)
QEMUorq -up-> Orch : wg-HUB NAT (QEMU)

' ============================================================
' LEYENDA al pie (compacta)
' ============================================================

note bottom of wg_overlay
  **Orchestrator admin-only**: un operador · sin _enforce_tenant · AUTH_TOKEN=ADMIN_TOKEN · sin USER_ID
  **Sin aislamiento**: 8 peers sin user_id (amarillo) · peer.get libre · misma red 10.20.30.0/24
  **Caso de uso**: CI/CD con token admin único · pruebas de topología puras sin validar auth entre usuarios
end note

@enduml
